CERN Tape Archive:
The command-line tool for reading files from a CTA tape.
%files -n cta-readtp
%license COPYING
%attr(0750,cta,tape) %caps(cap_sys_rawio=ep) %{_bindir}/cta-readtp
%attr(0644,root,root) %doc %{_mandir}/man1/cta-readtp.1cta*

%package -n cta-common
Summary: CERN Tape Archive common items
Requires(pre): %{_bindir}/grep, %{_sbindir}/luseradd
%description -n cta-common
CERN Tape Archive common items, such as the creation of the cta local user.
%pre -n cta-common
%{_bindir}/grep -q '^cta:' %{_sysconfdir}/passwd || %{_sbindir}/luseradd -s %{_sbindir}/nologin -c "CTA system account" -g tape cta
%files -n cta-common
%license COPYING
%doc CHANGELOG.md

%package -n cta-release
Summary: Repository configuration for CTA and its dependencies
Requires: python3-dnf-plugin-versionlock
Requires: python3
Requires: epel-release
Requires: jq
%description -n cta-release
Repository configuration for CTA and its dependencies
This package contains .repo files, gpg keys and versionlock configuration for CTA
%files -n cta-release
%license COPYING
%attr(0644,root,root) %config(noreplace) %{_sysconfdir}/yum.repos.d/*
%attr(0644,root,root) %{_sysconfdir}/pki/rpm-gpg/*
%attr(0644,root,root) %{_sysconfdir}/yum/pluginconf.d/versionlock.cta
%attr(0755,root,root) %{_bindir}/cta-versionlock

%package -n cta-eosdf
Summary: Report free space for EOS-managed CTA disk buffers
Requires: xrootd-client %{xrootdVersionConstraint}
Requires: sed
%description -n cta-eosdf
cta-eosdf reports free disk space in the default EOS namespace.
%files -n cta-eosdf
%license COPYING
%attr(0755,cta,tape) %{_bindir}/cta-eosdf.sh
